{
  "evidence_boundary": "Read-only initiator inventory across every production-validated same-turn post-capture continuation. Ship opponents are checked for an independent T-1 Kill!/Primary-Enemy request against the captured ship's new owner. Planet/base opponents are checked only for the documented NUK/ATT attack-code trigger. The captured ship's own T-1 orders are reported as a historical alternative but are never assumed to persist through capture. Missing old captured-ship T-1 orders are therefore informational and never block acceptance. Hard acceptance requires a resolved independent opponent initiator for every continuation. This diagnostic does not yet apply diplomacy or matching-FC suppression to the initiator candidates, nor infer the newly generated capture target list.",
